{
  "about": "Which .bib a file of a document uses, for an entry a placed snippet brings (bibFor in hooks/lib/copies.ts, bib_for in server/rft_manuscript.py: both are held to these cases). The nearest \\bibliography or \\addbibresource that covers the file: in the file itself, else in the files that take it in, up to the main file; else what the user chose for it before; else the one .bib the document names anywhere, or the one it has; else the user is asked.",
  "cases": [
    {"why": "one bibliography in the main file covers the main file",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\bibliographystyle{plainnat}\n\\bibliography{refs}\n\\end{document}\n", "refs.bib": ""},
     "file": "main.tex", "want": {"bib": "refs.bib"}},
    {"why": "and every file the main file takes in",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\input{sections/method}\n\\bibliography{refs}\n\\end{document}\n", "sections/method.tex": "\\section{Method}\n", "refs.bib": "", "other.bib": ""},
     "file": "sections/method.tex", "want": {"bib": "refs.bib"}},
    {"why": "a bibliography per chapter: the chapter's own",
     "main": "thesis.tex", "files": {"thesis.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\include{chapters/a}\n\\include{chapters/b}\n\\end{document}\n", "chapters/a.tex": "\\chapter{A}\n\\input{chapters/a/intro}\n\\bibliography{chapters/a}\n", "chapters/a/intro.tex": "Intro.\n", "chapters/b.tex": "\\chapter{B}\n\\bibliography{chapters/b}\n", "chapters/a.bib": "", "chapters/b.bib": ""},
     "file": "chapters/b.tex", "want": {"bib": "chapters/b.bib"}},
    {"why": "a section of a chapter: the chapter's, found through the file that takes the section in",
     "main": "thesis.tex", "files": {"thesis.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\include{chapters/a}\n\\include{chapters/b}\n\\end{document}\n", "chapters/a.tex": "\\chapter{A}\n\\input{chapters/a/intro}\n\\bibliography{chapters/a}\n", "chapters/a/intro.tex": "Intro.\n", "chapters/b.tex": "\\chapter{B}\n\\bibliography{chapters/b}\n", "chapters/a.bib": "", "chapters/b.bib": ""},
     "file": "chapters/a/intro.tex", "want": {"bib": "chapters/a.bib"}},
    {"why": "the AAU thesis as it comes: each paper's bibliography is a macro of setup/macros.tex, and the document names one .bib in all",
     "main": "master.tex", "files": {"master.tex": "\\input{setup/macros.tex}\n\\begin{document}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperA/paperA}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperB/paperB}\n\\end{document}\n", "setup/macros.tex": "\\newcommand{\\introbib}{\\bibliographystyle{IEEEtranS}\\bibliography{bib/mybib}}\n\\newcommand{\\papersbib}{%\n  \\bibliographystyle{IEEEtran}\n  \\bibliography{bib/mybib}\n}\n", "papers/paperA/paperA.tex": "\\input{papers/paperA/sections/introduction.tex}\n\\papersbib\n", "papers/paperA/sections/introduction.tex": "Intro.\n", "papers/paperB/paperB.tex": "\\papersbib\n", "bib/mybib.bib": ""},
     "file": "papers/paperA/sections/introduction.tex", "want": {"bib": "bib/mybib.bib"}},
    {"why": "the AAU thesis with a .bib of paper A's own: paper A's files use it",
     "main": "master.tex", "files": {"master.tex": "\\input{setup/macros.tex}\n\\begin{document}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperA/paperA}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperB/paperB}\n\\end{document}\n", "setup/macros.tex": "\\newcommand{\\papersbib}{\\bibliographystyle{IEEEtran}\\bibliography{bib/mybib}}\n", "papers/paperA/paperA.tex": "\\input{papers/paperA/sections/introduction.tex}\n\\bibliographystyle{IEEEtran}\n\\bibliography{papers/paperA/refs}\n", "papers/paperA/sections/introduction.tex": "Intro.\n", "papers/paperB/paperB.tex": "\\papersbib\n", "bib/mybib.bib": "", "papers/paperA/refs.bib": ""},
     "file": "papers/paperA/sections/introduction.tex", "want": {"bib": "papers/paperA/refs.bib"}},
    {"why": "and paper B, whose bibliography is still the macro's: two .bib files are named and nothing covers paper B, so the user is asked",
     "main": "master.tex", "files": {"master.tex": "\\input{setup/macros.tex}\n\\begin{document}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperA/paperA}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperB/paperB}\n\\end{document}\n", "setup/macros.tex": "\\newcommand{\\papersbib}{\\bibliographystyle{IEEEtran}\\bibliography{bib/mybib}}\n", "papers/paperA/paperA.tex": "\\bibliography{papers/paperA/refs}\n", "papers/paperB/paperB.tex": "\\input{papers/paperB/sections/introduction}\n\\papersbib\n", "papers/paperB/sections/introduction.tex": "Intro.\n", "bib/mybib.bib": "", "papers/paperA/refs.bib": ""},
     "file": "papers/paperB/sections/introduction.tex", "want": {"ask": ["bib/mybib.bib", "papers/paperA/refs.bib"]}},
    {"why": "asked once: what the user chose for a file stands for it, and for the files it takes in",
     "main": "master.tex", "files": {"master.tex": "\\input{setup/macros.tex}\n\\begin{document}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperA/paperA}\n\\includepaper{papers/paperB/paperB}\n\\end{document}\n", "setup/macros.tex": "\\newcommand{\\papersbib}{\\bibliographystyle{IEEEtran}\\bibliography{bib/mybib}}\n", "papers/paperA/paperA.tex": "\\bibliography{papers/paperA/refs}\n", "papers/paperB/paperB.tex": "\\input{papers/paperB/sections/introduction}\n\\papersbib\n", "papers/paperB/sections/introduction.tex": "Intro.\n", "bib/mybib.bib": "", "papers/paperA/refs.bib": ""},
     "file": "papers/paperB/sections/introduction.tex", "chosen": {"papers/paperB/paperB.tex": "bib/mybib.bib"}, "want": {"bib": "bib/mybib.bib"}},
    {"why": "biblatex: \\addbibresource, with its extension and an option",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\usepackage{biblatex}\n\\addbibresource[label=main]{literature.bib}\n\\begin{document}\n\\input{sections/one}\n\\printbibliography\n\\end{document}\n", "sections/one.tex": "One.\n", "literature.bib": "", "old.bib": ""},
     "file": "sections/one.tex", "want": {"bib": "literature.bib"}},
    {"why": "several files in one \\bibliography: the first",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\bibliography{mine, strings ,other}\n\\end{document}\n", "mine.bib": "", "strings.bib": "", "other.bib": ""},
     "file": "main.tex", "want": {"bib": "mine.bib"}},
    {"why": "a bibliography in a comment names nothing; the document's one .bib is used",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\begin{document}\n% \\bibliography{old}\n\\end{document}\n", "literature.bib": ""},
     "file": "main.tex", "want": {"bib": "literature.bib"}},
    {"why": "no .bib named and none there: refs.bib, beside the main file",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\end{document}\n"},
     "file": "main.tex", "want": {"bib": "refs.bib"}},
    {"why": "no .bib named and two there: asked",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\end{document}\n", "a.bib": "", "b.bib": ""},
     "file": "main.tex", "want": {"ask": ["a.bib", "b.bib"]}},
    {"why": "a main file in a folder: what it names is read from that folder",
     "main": "src/paper.tex", "files": {"src/paper.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\input{parts/one}\n\\bibliography{refs}\n\\end{document}\n", "src/parts/one.tex": "One.\n", "src/refs.bib": "", "refs.bib": ""},
     "file": "src/parts/one.tex", "want": {"bib": "src/refs.bib"}},
    {"why": "a file nothing takes in: the one .bib the document names",
     "main": "main.tex", "files": {"main.tex": "\\begin{document}\n\\bibliography{refs}\n\\end{document}\n", "draft.tex": "A draft.\n", "refs.bib": "", "old.bib": ""},
     "file": "draft.tex", "want": {"bib": "refs.bib"}}
  ]
}
